#: data/org.gnome.Mahjongg.appdata.xml.in:7
msgid "GNOME Mahjongg"
msgstr "Mahjongg de GNOME"

#: data/org.gnome.Mahjongg.appdata.xml.in:8
msgid "Match tiles and clear the board"
msgstr "Empareyar fiches iguales y llimiar el tableru"

#: data/org.gnome.Mahjongg.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"A solitaire version of the classic Eastern tile game. Tiles are stacked on "
"the board at the start of the game. The goal is to remove all the tiles in "
"as little time as possible. Select two matching tiles and they will "
"disappear from the board, but you can only select a tile if there is an "
"empty space to its left or right at the same level. Be careful: tiles that "
"look alike may actually be slightly different."
msgstr ""
"Una versión del solitariu Eastern. Les fiches amontónense nel tableru al "
"entamu del xuegu. L'oxetivu ye quitar toles fiches nel menor tiempu posible. "
"Escueyi dos fiches iguales y desapaecerán del tableru, pero sólo pues "
"escoyer una ficha si tienes un espaciu valeru a la to manzorga o a la "
"mandrecha nel mesmu nive. Ten curiáu: hai fiches que s'asemeyen abondo pero "
"que son un pocu diferentes."

#: data/org.gnome.Mahjongg.appdata.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"GNOME Mahjongg features a variety of starting layouts, some easy and some "
"difficult. If you get stuck, you can ask for a hint, but this adds a large "
"time penalty."
msgstr ""
"GNOME Mahjongg tien delles distribuciones iniciales, delles fáciles y delles "
"difíciles. Si tienes problemss, pues pidir una pista, pero esto añade una "
"penalización de tiempu."

#: data/org.gnome.Mahjongg.appdata.xml.in:40
msgid "The GNOME Project"
msgstr "El Proyeutu GNOME"

